  "title": "Dam olish rejalari: wollen",
  "title_de": "Was willst du am Wochenende machen?",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida \"wollen\" fe'lini tuslaysiz, dam olish kunlari rejalaringizni aytasiz (Am Samstag will ich ...), \"Lust haben\" bilan xohishingizni bildirasiz va \"wollen\" bilan \"möchten\" farqini bilasiz.",
  "skill_focus": [
    "grammar",
    "speaking",
    "listening"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "\"wollen\" — xohlamoq, niyat qilmoq. U qat'iy xohish yoki rejani bildiradi: Am Samstag will ich joggen. Boshqa modal fe'llar kabi ikkinchi fe'l gap oxirida turadi."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Shaxs",
        "wollen",
        "möchten (eslatma)"
      ],
